# 🔟 Huffman Coding

## Problem

Generate:

```text
Minimum Length
Prefix Codes
```

---

### Example Frequencies

```text
a → 5

b → 9

c → 12

d → 13

e → 16

f → 45
```

---

# 1️⃣1️⃣ Greedy Idea

Always merge:

```text
Two Lowest Frequencies
```

---

### Use

```cpp
Priority Queue
(Min Heap)
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N log N)
```

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Why Huffman Works?

Lowest frequencies:

```text
Get Largest Depth
```

High frequencies:

```text
Stay Near Root
```

Result:

```text
Minimum Encoding Cost
```

---

